          "type": "rule",
          "text": "The solutions of $ax^2+bx+c=0$ with $a\\neq0$ and $a, b, c \\in R$ are given by the quadratic formula. Formula: $x=\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{b^2-4ac}}{2a}$",
